Original commit body from e82cd9d:

Add _detect_ruby_frameworks() and _detect_elixir_frameworks() functions
to enable AUTO mode to detect frameworks from Gemfile and mix.exs files.
Previously RUBY_FRAMEWORKS and ELIXIR_FRAMEWORKS dictionaries existed
but were never used because detection functions were missing.

Ruby frameworks detected: Rails, Sinatra, Grape, Hanami, Roda, Padrino,
graphql-ruby, thor/gli/dry-cli (CLI), rspec, minitest.

Elixir frameworks detected: Phoenix, Plug, Ecto, Absinthe, ex_unit.
